# www frontend

- CSS Modules only in `www/` — no Tailwind in site components.
- Colors: `--avalon-*` tokens, not hardcoded hex.
- Typeface: Hubot Sans. Headings: `text-transform: uppercase`.
- Inline SVGs in islands need `width` and `height` attributes (otherwise they flash at 300×150 before CSS/hydration).
- GSAP entrance: hide the scene in CSS (`opacity: 0`), then `tl.set(scene, { opacity: 1 })`. Do not rely on `gsap.from({ opacity: 0 })` alone.
- Footer brand watermark: `paint-order: stroke fill` with `color` matching the background and `-webkit-text-stroke`. Never `color: transparent`.
